mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="Times New Roman">Course </font></span></b><b><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-weight:bold;
font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;">Description</span></b><b><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-ascii-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-hansi-font-family:'Times New Roman';
mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:bold;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-spacerun:'yes';">&nbsp;</span></span></b><b><span
                                    style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-weight:bold;
font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;">(</span></b><b><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-ascii-font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-hansi-font-family:'Times New Roman';
mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-weight:bold;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="Times New Roman">in English</font></span></b><b><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-weight:bold;
font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;">)</span></b><b><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-weight:bold;
font-size:10.5000pt;mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>

                </td>
                <td width=572 valign=center colspan=10 style="width:343.6000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:none;
mso-border-left-alt:none;border-right:1.0000pt solid windowtext;mso-border-right-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;
border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;border-bottom:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>Obstetrics and Gynecology is the medical discipline dedicated to the study of the female reproductive system, encompassing its physiology and pathology throughout all stages of life, as well as the physiology of pregnancy and childbirth. This course primarily covers the fundamentals of the field and diseases of the female reproductive system.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>The course is designed to provide a clear and concise overview of common and frequent diseases in obstetrics and gynecology, with a strong emphasis on clinical relevance. Through a combination of large-group lectures and clinical demonstrations, students will acquire a solid grasp of the fundamental theories, knowledge, and clinical skills. They will learn the progression, diagnostic methods, and treatment protocols for common gynecological and obstetrical conditions, as well as women’s healthcare and family planning measures. Furthermore, the course will actively introduce students to the latest advancements and cutting-edge research in both the clinical and scientific fields of obstetrics and gynecology.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>An integral component of the course is the integration of medical ethics and humanities. It addresses key topics such as doctor-patient communication, childbirth and childcare, family dynamics, bodily privacy, and reproductive ethics. This content aims to cultivate students’ appreciation for humanistic principles and a holistic understanding of the human life cycle. The ultimate objective is to foster sound professional values and well-rounded competencies, preparing students to become compassionate and trustworthy physicians.</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>As per the curriculum, the Obstetrics and Gynecology course is conducted over a 16-week period, comprising 46 hours of lectures and 30 hours of clinical clerkship and demonstrations.</p></font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="height:19.9000pt;">
                <td width=777 valign=center colspan=14 style="width:466.7000pt;padding:0.0000pt 5.4000pt 0.0000pt 5.4000pt ;border-left:1.0000pt solid windowtext;
